# Consumers of this repo's skills/ — one per line, gitignored copy at `.consumers`.
#
#   <path relative to this repo>[|flags]
#
# Paths are relative on purpose: an absolute path would carry a home directory
# into a file that is easy to paste somewhere public.
#
# Flags:
#   deploys   this repo redeploys production on push, so the script commits
#             but never pushes it — you push that one deliberately
#
# A consumer with .claude-plugin/plugin.json gets its version bumped in the
# same commit as the sync. One without (a vault MCP server) just gets skills/.
#
# Example:
# ../clients/acme/acme-ai
# ../clients/acme/acme-vault-mcp|deploys
